  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"1999-09-22T09:11:00Z\"\u003e22 September 1999\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  No tax legislation pre-election\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Bill English\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Treasurer\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eTreasurer Bill English said today speculation that the Government planned to  introduce tax legislation before the election was incorrect. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u0026#34;The Government has no plans to introduce tax legislation before the  election,\u0026#34; he said. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Treasurer Bill English said today speculation that the Government planned to  introduce tax legislation before the election was incorrect. \"The Government has no plans to introduce tax legislation before the  election,\" he said.",
